{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道自己舍不得什么，可先前硬撑的疲惫还在，眼下提不起劲。\",\n      \"key\": \"硬撑的疲惫\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他记得行动曾让自己重新有了力气，那种安宁也确实安慰过他。\",\n      \"key\": \"重新有了力气\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他想往前护住那种安宁，却怕又只顾硬撑，歇下来又放不下那些妨碍它的事。\",\n      \"key\": \"护住那种安宁\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他想着自己要护住的还是那种安宁，歇一歇也不等于把它丢下。\",\n      \"key\": \"歇一歇\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他还想不出怎么两边都顾到，却不愿把任何一边说成错的，也没那么觉得非得舍掉一边才能往下走了。\",\n      \"key\": \"马上选边\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S10-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R45\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S10-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留知道舍不得什么却未能立刻勇敢的距离，把无力具体落在先前硬撑留下的疲惫上。去掉连自己为什么舍不得都说不清的说法，因为上一段已经明确了他舍不得的是什么。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R46\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S10-2\", \"S10-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆开并具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"明说行动曾让他重新有力，安宁也曾给他真实的安慰；再分别写出两者眼下的难处。找回盲评反复指出的两条路都曾真正帮助过他的内容，不再只用两条路各有难处概括。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R47\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S10-3\", \"S10-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并保留\",\n      \"why\": \"保留继续争取时不能忘记自己想护住的安宁、歇下来也不能丢下威胁它的事情。把原先整齐的条件句改成他实际面对的两难，同时保留上一轮已经写出的歇一歇不等于放弃的认识。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R48\", \"R49\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S10-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并补足因果\",\n      \"why\": \"删去反复思量、暂时无力等重复表达，保留尚想不出两边如何兼顾的事实。补出松动的心理桥梁：两边都曾帮过他，他不愿把任何一边说成错的，因此不再那么逼自己非得舍掉一边才能继续。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cb387ae6-53a7-4e12-8d21-a89b1230fddb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T002821837201Z", "elapsed_seconds": 140.359, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:30:42.220946+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e9caa5bc63102dcd7314b24183c57003a40c1aa77582a4d49850115a1ce8f14b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py"